[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0546","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0546.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0804","title":"Linux Kernel 2.2.x ICMP 畸形数据包拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 2.2.x 内核的 ICMP 协议处理模块存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含异常类型、代码及畸形 IP 头部长度的特制 ICMP 数据包，触发内核协议栈处理异常，导致系统崩溃或服务不可用。该漏洞影响 Linux 2.2/2.3 内核版本，涉及 Debian 2.1、RedHat 6.0、SuSE 6.1 等发行版，攻击无需认证，远程即可实施。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0804"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"1999-06-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:05Z","remediation":"升级至 Linux 2.4.x 及以上内核版本，该漏洞已在 2.4.0 中修复。如无法升级内核，可通过 iptables 添加规则丢弃异常 ICMP 包：iptables -A INPUT -p icmp -m icmp --icmp-type 8 -j DROP。建议升级至仍有安全支持的发行版（如 RHEL 7+、Ubuntu 16.04+）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/302","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19241","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0804.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0804","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-1999-0804.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0804.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r76w-gfvq-4v99/GHSA-r76w-gfvq-4v99.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0804.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/1999/19990607.data","https://github.com/shamedgh/confine/blob/a75dad3ad336e6258a42cd1ce4af061eea68ed76/cve.files/cveToFile.json.type.csv","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0546.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0499","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0499.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0772","title":"康柏 Insight Management Agent 长字符串拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Compaq Management Agents和Compaq Survey Utility存在拒绝服务漏洞，由于程序对输入数据缺乏充分的长度校验，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过网络向目标系统的2301端口发送超长字符串，触发服务异常崩溃或系统无响应。该漏洞影响运行Compaq Insight Management Agent及相关管理代理服务的服务器系统，攻击条件简单，仅需目标端口网络可达即可实施利用，无需任何凭据，导致合法用户无法正常访问管理服务，影响系统可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0772"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-06-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:01Z","remediation":"升级 Compaq Insight Management Agent 及 Survey Utility 至 Compaq 官方发布的修复版本，或安装对应 SoftPaq 安全补丁；如暂无法升级，应在防火墙或主机 ACL 中限制仅允许可信管理网段访问 TCP 2301 端口，并临时禁用不必要的 Compaq Survey Utility 服务以降低被攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0772","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7cda0b7fa75f17f1e2b56ef076a6f9175f854ab4/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0772.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0772","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0772.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4cacb08131e7c4736ad136de17873dbcaeddf850/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0772.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/958f1672375e115879b3a6bd13e3638812260c7d/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-545v-66g8-w7vj/GHSA-545v-66g8-w7vj.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0772.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000656.txt","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0499.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1130","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1130.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1485","title":"SGI IRIX nsd 虚拟文件系统导出远程信息泄露漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 操作系统 6.5 至 6.5.2 版本的 nsd（网络存储守护进程）存在信息泄露漏洞。该服务默认在 UDP 端口上导出一个虚拟文件系统，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过挂载该虚拟文件系统，越权读取目标系统上的任意文件，获取敏感信息，同时可能因大量请求导致拒绝服务。该漏洞可被远程利用，攻击复杂度低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1485"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-05-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:32Z","remediation":"立即升级 SGI IRIX 至 6.5.3 或更高版本，该版本已修复 nsd 虚拟文件系统远程挂载漏洞。如无法立即升级，在防火墙上限制对目标主机 UDP 1024-1029 端口的入站访问，并禁用 nsd 服务的远程 NFS 导出功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92818552106912&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/8564","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/412","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2246","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2247","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19316","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/1999/CVE-1999-1485.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b4109a5f204e995e8b4c403f2d8e63073bf1f4d9/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1485.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1485","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/1999.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ed836d32ec0f7204df361b2aedfef822b3e814e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1485.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1485.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fe37e86b4ab6d44c1acc95d76e30f97043bfd67f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gph4-8wj3-3mgr/GHSA-gph4-8wj3-3mgr.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1485.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b806245e-5163-48ad-8c76-8f42a7ab790e.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1130.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0806","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0806.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0802","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9107,\"outputTokens\":22,\"totalTokens\":10793}}","description":"Internet Explorer 5 的收藏夹图标（Favorites icon）处理功能存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当浏览器解析攻击者构造的畸形收藏夹图标文件时，由于未对输入数据长度进行正确边界校验，会导致缓冲区溢出，使远程攻击者能够在目标用户系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响使用 Internet Explorer 5 的 Windows 系统，攻击者可借助恶意网页或诱导用户导入特制收藏夹图标的方式触发，无需身份认证，只要受害者访问恶意内容即可实现远程代码执行，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0802"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:05Z","remediation":"升级至 Internet Explorer 5.01 SP2 或 IE 5.5 及以上版本，并安装微软 2000 年 3 月安全汇总补丁（如 Windows Update 中的 IE 累积更新）。如暂无法升级，可在浏览器安全设置中将「收藏夹」及 Active Desktop 相关脚本禁用，并通过代理过滤畸形 Favorites 图标(.ico)响应作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ231450","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-018","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/638563f1ec085a412c2e42f3935801ae34f0dfd9/1999/CVE-1999-0802.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e46881568ba1d1c2011ec61282a082880cda856/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0802.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/57cb981038a97031bd95a35a9b10bbed18ca4725/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0802.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0802","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0802.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/134977c5f4ce4f427a914ca161b4f075e34b560b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0802.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0802.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9ddbd359f5d34d4a30a937d3247f869d55e5f670/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-08xx/CVE-1999-0802.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6aa4dba00ee770284d0dfd313876db0eed616986/1999/CVE-1999-0802.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0802.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0806.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0467","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0467.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0755","title":"Microsoft Windows NT RAS 拨号网络密码缓存漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 及其 SP1 至 SP5 版本的远程访问服务（RAS）与路由和远程访问服务（RRAS）客户端存在密码缓存缺陷。当用户通过拨号网络连接进行登录时，系统会在用户并未勾选\"保存密码\"选项的情况下，仍将用户的登录密码缓存在本地。这意味着任何能够访问该主机的本地用户，都可能在未经授权的情况下读取到此前连接所用凭据，进而导致敏感账户信息的泄露。该漏洞影响范围涵盖上述所有受影响的 Windows NT 4.0 系统版本，攻击条件为攻击者需具备对目标主机的本地访问权限，利用方式则是直接读取系统缓存中已存储的明文或可逆密码数据。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0755"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:59Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 于 1999 年 5 月发布的安全更新 MS99-017 补丁，该补丁修复了 RAS/RRAS 客户端无论是否勾选\"保存密码\"选项都会缓存凭据的问题。补丁适用于 Windows NT 4.0 Workstation、Server 及 Enterprise Edition。如无法安装补丁，可启用 SYSKEY 功能（Windows NT 4.0 SP4 及以上）对注册表中存储的密码数据进行强加密作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ230681","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-017","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19196","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/cf29b986be3ae7c9144123b101d864868676099e/1999/CVE-1999-0755.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e268305fd8644994d337819e469d1f89bafde833/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0755.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0755","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/76af88afbb282d6c9e8ce3b9f6942bcb7e39be57/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0755.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0755.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d9ad03f9df46533ce9229f9da6bbf66bd77a3f4f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g6q4-7rrm-ppv6/GHSA-g6q4-7rrm-ppv6.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0755.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0467.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0716","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0716.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0917","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer Preloader ActiveX 控件任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 4.0 和 5.0 版本中的 Preloader ActiveX 控件存在安全漏洞，远程攻击者可通过构造特制网页，利用该控件读取目标系统上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击条件为诱导用户访问恶意页面，无需用户交互即可触发文件读取操作。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0917"],"sources":["cve","epss"],"published":"1999-05-27T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"安装微软安全公告 MS99-018 提供的更新补丁，或升级 Internet Explorer 至更高版本。对于无法升级的系统，可通过设置 kill bit 禁用 Preloader ActiveX 控件来缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:46:43Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-018","http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ231452"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0716.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0716.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1308","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1308.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0920","title":"University of Washington IMAP pop2d 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"University of Washington IMAP 软件包中的 pop2d POP 守护进程存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者通过向 FOLD 命令发送约 1000 字节的超长参数，可触发栈溢出，覆盖返回地址，从而以 nobody 用户权限执行任意代码。攻击者需先通过匿名代理功能登录认证，攻击条件为目标运行 pop2d 4.4 及更早版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0920"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb","nvd"],"published":"1999-05-26T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 University of Washington IMAP 软件包至 4.5 或更高版本，该版本修复了 pop2d 中 FOLD 命令的缓冲区边界检查问题。如无法升级，建议禁用 pop2d 服务（端口 109），改用更安全的 pop3d 或 IMAP 协议替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/283","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19226","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0920","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/638563f1ec085a412c2e42f3935801ae34f0dfd9/1999/CVE-1999-0920.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a662dc905cd549a2105daacbfce64cf01652761d/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0920.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0920.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19226"],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1308.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0496","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0496.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0771","title":"Compaq Survey Utility Web 文件访问 - 目录遍历（CVE-1999-0771）","description":"Compaq Management Agents 和 Compaq Survey Utility 的网络组件允许远程攻击者通过使用「..」攻击（目录遍历）来读取任意文件。此漏洞影响多个版本，包括 Compaq Client Management Agents 4.0+，Survey Utility 2.0+，以及相关的 Insight Manager、Intelligent Cluster Administrator Management Agents 等产品。攻击者无需身份验证即可访问 Web 管理组件，并通过 URL 中包含目录遍历序列「../」的请求来读取目标系统上的敏感文件，例如 WinNT/repair/sam._ 文件或 NetWare 系统上的 ldremote.ncf 文件。漏洞原理在于 Web 服务器未能验证所请求的路径是否超出了其文档树范围。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0771"],"sources":["nvd"],"published":"1999-05-26T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到 HP Management Agents 的最新支持版本或确保已应用最新的补丁；如果产品已停止支持，建议彻底卸载 Survey Utility 和 Web 管理组件，并改用受支持的 HP 管理方案替代；禁用 Web 管理组件的远程访问功能；在防火墙级别限制仅允许受信任管理 IP 访问 Web 管理端口 (通常为 2301)。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0771","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19225","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0771"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0496.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0539","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0539.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0803","title":"IBM AIX eNetwork Firewall 不安全临时文件创建漏洞","description":"IBM AIX eNetwork Firewall 3.2 与 3.3 版本中的 fwluser 脚本在创建临时文件时未采取安全的文件创建方式，存在不安全临时文件创建漏洞。本地已登录的普通用户可利用符号链接（symlink）攻击手段，在脚本写入临时文件的过程中将链接指向任意系统文件，从而以脚本运行权限覆盖或写入目标文件内容。该漏洞影响运行上述版本防火墙软件的 AIX 系统，攻击条件为攻击者需具备本地账户并能在脚本执行期间实施符号链接替换，利用方式相对简单，CVSS 基础评分 2.1，危害等级较低，但可能导致本地文件被篡改或权限提升。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0803"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1999-05-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:05Z","remediation":"建议升级至 IBM AIX eNetwork Firewall 3.4 或更高版本（已修复该临时文件竞争条件）。若无法升级，请为 /tmp 目录启用粘滞位（chmod +t /tmp），并限制 fwluser 脚本的写入权限（chmod 755 /usr/lpp/fw/bin/fwluser），同时在防火墙层面禁止非受信本地用户登录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=92765973207648&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/962","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19229","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/770e8f09ce14e637a09c7c619e10772aa6172bea/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0803.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0803","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0803.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e1298ff7aafe81b936ca67ecef34c3124d6c72f0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0803.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2a2be81fd4b47dc35d815a995b6429bd116a3b84/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-59f5-phf9-mq45/GHSA-59f5-phf9-mq45.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0803.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--53295666-d1a4-44a0-9681-9213e3b76b09.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0539.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0539.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0539.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1102","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1102.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1414","title":"IBM Netfinity Remote Control 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"IBM Netfinity Remote Control（远程控制软件）的进程管理器组件以系统级权限（SYSTEM）运行，存在权限提升漏洞。本地用户可通过该进程管理器启动任意程序，导致程序以 SYSTEM 权限执行，从而获得管理员权限。攻击者只需拥有本地访问权限即可利用，无需额外认证。成功利用后可完全控制目标系统，包括读取、修改任意文件及执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 IBM Netfinity Remote Control 1.0 版本，CVSS v2.0 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1414"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"1999-05-25T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 IBM Netfinity Remote Control 至最新版本，或迁移至受支持的远程管理方案（如 IBM Director）。限制可本地登录服务器的用户账户，仅允许管理员组成员使用该软件。在组策略中禁用进程管理器对非管理员用户的访问权限，并启用操作系统最小权限原则。由于该产品已停止维护，建议彻底替换为受支持的远程控制软件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=92765856706547&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=92902484317769&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/284"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1102.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0478","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0478.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0762","title":"Netscape Communicator about 协议信息泄露漏洞","description":"Netscape Communicator 浏览器在处理 HTML 页面时存在信息泄露漏洞。当页面的 TITLE 标签中嵌入 JavaScript 代码时，远程攻击者可利用浏览器的 \"about:\" 协议访问浏览器内部敏感信息（如历史记录、书签或配置数据）。该漏洞影响 Netscape Communicator 的多个早期版本，攻击条件为用户访问攻击者控制的恶意网页。攻击者通过构造包含特定 JavaScript 的 HTML 页面，诱导用户点击访问，即可在无需身份认证的情况下窃取浏览器信息，造成隐私泄露。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0762"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-05-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:00Z","remediation":"升级 Netscape Communicator 至 4.51 或更高版本（该版本已修复通过“about”协议读取浏览器信息的问题）。若无法立即升级，可在浏览器配置中禁用 JavaScript 执行（编辑 prefs.js 设置 javascript.enabled=false）或通过网络代理/防火墙规则拦截含有 about: 协议的异常请求，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0762","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e268305fd8644994d337819e469d1f89bafde833/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0762.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0762","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0762.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0ea6b1a1298433599abdd2a4c6b6ce9f09476665/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0762.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d9ad03f9df46533ce9229f9da6bbf66bd77a3f4f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f3w3-q24x-r8rh/GHSA-f3w3-q24x-r8rh.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0762.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000645.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/134977c5f4ce4f427a914ca161b4f075e34b560b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0762.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0478.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github